I'd remove the compulsion aspect, just making it that the recipes have to be followed to the letter. Perhaps keep the changing content - new recipes appearing in the book that the person will consider merely not having noticed before. People doing things like getting rendered infant fat to ensure improvement of their social standing of their own will (and believe me , there are such) is far, far creepier than people being compelled to.</p>
